This PR does several small changes to the overall configuration of the project:

- Turns on `--noImplicitOverride` as a best practice, although this package does not actually use overrides much;
- Generate a `tsconfig.json` file in directories excluded from the root `tsconfig.json` file, as VSCode _only_ looks at files with that name, but will always use the one closest in the file tree to the file being edited;
- Opt out of `inlineSourceMap`, and enable `declarationMap` to further enhance the IDE experience, and reduce `.js` file sizes (which has a known positive impact on load times);
- Fix tests that were flaky due to concurrently using the `jsii-calc` package fixtures with different configurations.



